/*!
@defgroup memory MEMORY Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides device-specific memory map definitions
for MCUXpresso SDK devices.

This driver supplies the address-range macros used throughout the SDK to
translate between primary and aliased views of on-chip memories, including:
  - ITCM / DTCM start, end and alias-offset definitions
  - Cached and uncached aliases for the XSPI LLC ranges
  - Helper macros for converting between alias and physical addresses

*/
